1
00:00:04,139 --> 00:00:05,880
Agents begin with a description.

2
00:00:06,054 --> 00:00:08,736
Type a sentence about the character you want,

3
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:11,700
and the Agent Studio drafts a name, a bio template,

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,701
and variables that become knobs.

5
00:00:14,048 --> 00:00:16,913
Tune the personality live, try a test message,

6
00:00:16,913 --> 00:00:20,483
then save the profile to your library or add it straight to a session.

7
00:00:34,736 --> 00:00:36,925
Agents work together in a session.

8
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:39,782
In the Session room, pick a quick-start template,

9
00:00:39,782 --> 00:00:43,705
such as the Creative Brainstorm Panel, and give the team a shared goal.

10
00:00:44,222 --> 00:00:46,151
Launch Session opens Agent Studio,

11
00:00:46,151 --> 00:00:48,995
where all four agents start talking straight away.

12
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,381
Nudge the conversation whenever you like,

13
00:00:51,381 --> 00:00:53,482
since your message reaches them as the user,

14
00:00:53,482 --> 00:00:55,937
and stop the session when you have what you need.
